docs {
    GET  /archive/books    librarian, admin
    GET  /archive/copies   librarian, admin

  Logically deleted books, and copies deleted on their own, most recently deleted first.
  The journal behind them names borrowers, hence staff only: a student
  gets 403. The timeline of any one of them is `getBookHistory` / `getCopyHistory`.
}
